sequenceDiagram
    participant S as FontStack
    participant SF as SystemFonts
    participant IX as SystemFontIndex
    participant FD as FontData
    S->>SF: Resolve(codepoint)
    SF->>SF: Enabled? (override or OneTextSettings.SystemFontFallback)
    SF->>SF: lock s_sync, s_resolved lookup (negatives cached too)
    SF->>IX: Files()
    IX-->>SF: sorted font paths for this platform (Directories, Excluded lastresort/adobeblank)
    SF->>SF: ScriptOf(codepoint), s_answered memory first
    SF->>IX: Stems()
    SF->>SF: PreferredThenGeneric(codepoint) name fragments, then every file
    loop TryFile(path) per candidate, FilesProbed++
        SF->>IX: Coverage(path)
        IX->>IX: ReadCoverage: FaceOffsets (ttcf), ReadFace, ParseCmap (12 over 4 over 6 over 0)
        IX-->>SF: FaceCoverage[] ranges
        SF->>SF: face.Covers(codepoint) binary search
        SF->>FD: Load(File.ReadAllBytes(path), faceIndex)
        FD-->>SF: face, kept in s_faces keyed by path and face index
        SF->>IX: FamilyName(path, face) for s_names
        SF->>FD: HasGlyph(codepoint) confirms the cmap estimate
    end
    SF->>SF: Remember(script, path), s_resolved[codepoint] = face or null
    SF-->>S: FontData or null
    S->>S: _system[codepoint] = answer, then Primary if null
